(KT.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقِيقَةٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوْهَرٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَاتِيَّةٌ</span>,
